1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,700
Desert ants find their way home across
open sand without any landmarks.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,800
They count their steps and
read the angle of the sun.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,600
A forager

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,200
can walk more than a hundred meters

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,760
from the nest and still
return in a straight line.

6
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:15,730
Researchers once put tiny stilts on
the ants to make their steps longer,

7
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:19,810
those ants walked right past the nest
because their step count was wrong.

8
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:23,090
Small brains can do precise
work when the method is simple,

9
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:26,540
that is the idea behind small
models that run on your own device
